text:'{"blocks":[{"key":"ft0qe","text":"I’d say my biggest focus this year was building our leadership pipeline and improving how we set goals across the organization.\\n\\nOn the leadership side, we brought 12 employees into the pipeline. Nine completed the program, and five are now ready or close to ready for leadership roles. We also saw internal promotions increase from 18% to 26%, which was great to see.\\n\\nFor goal-setting, we had really strong adoption. More than 90% of managers entered goals and completed the training, and employee engagement around goals increased from 6.9 to 8.3.\\n\\nSo overall, I’m really happy with the progress we made around internal mobility and getting teams better aligned.\\n\\nOne area where I think we could do better, though, is program execution.","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[{"offset":0,"length":739,"style":"backgroundColor:unset"},{"offset":0,"length":739,"style":"defaultBackgroundColor:#E8D01B"},{"offset":0,"length":739,"style":"textHighlightEnable:false"},{"offset":0,"length":739,"style":"textShadowEnable:false"},{"offset":0,"length":739,"style":"overridden:false"},{"offset":0,"length":739,"style":"hlnk:"},{"offset":0,"length":739,"style":"hlnkt:wp"},{"offset":0,"length":739,"style":"textOutlineEnable:false"},{"offset":0,"length":739,"style":"opacity:1"},{"offset":0,"length":739,"style":"hlnke:true"}],"entityRanges":[],"data":{"presetId":"text-body-1","listDepth":"0","listType":"S_Bullets08","listIndent":"100%","listSize":"100%","listColor":"#666666","overridden":"false","verticalAlign":"middle"}}],"entityMap":{}}',
